1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
I just built this full multiplayer Attack on Titan game

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,480
inside of Claude Code,

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,740
and it only took me about an hour and $31.

4
00:00:06,179 --> 00:00:07,719
All I did was ask Claude to build me

5
00:00:07,719 --> 00:00:09,460
an Attack on Titan in Minecraft.

6
00:00:09,679 --> 00:00:11,000
And it came back with a full game

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,859
where you either play as a Survey Corps soldier

8
00:00:12,859 --> 00:00:13,720
cutting down Titans,

9
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:15,179
or it was one of the Titans themselves

10
00:00:15,179 --> 00:00:16,199
